    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "The confluence smelled of two springs at once: one water chalk-pale and quarry-cold, the other berry-dark and sweet with far orchards. {{bridge-smell}}. Under it all, warm shell. Two great mountain rivers met beneath ..."
